  <data name="AboutPage_MotivationTitle.Text" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Motivation</value>
  </data>
  <data name="AboutPage_MotivationContent.Text" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>The author habitually backs up photos to their computer due to limited storage space on their phone. However, Apple's Live Photos function on Windows results in separate images and videos, leading to a terrible browsing experience. Frustrated, the author developed this tool, finally liberating this perfectionist! []~(￣▽￣)~*</value>
  </data>
  <data name="AboutPage_CreditsTitle.Text" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Open Source Credits</value>
  </data>
  <data name="AboutPage_ExifToolSuffix.Text" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>(by Phil Harvey) — Global metadata parsing, injection, and XMP structure reconstruction</value>
  </data>
  <data name="AboutPage_JpegTranSuffix.Text" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>(by IJG) — Lossless JPEG transforms using DCT coefficient space, achieving zero-loss rotation without re-encoding</value>
  </data>
  <data name="AboutPage_FFmpegSuffix.Text" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>(by FFmpeg team) — Video transcoding and stream remuxing engine</value>
  </data>
  <data name="AboutPage_ImageMagickSuffix.Text" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>(by ImageMagick Studio / dlemstra) — HEIC/HEIF image decoding via libheif</value>
  </data>
  <data name="AboutPage_PrivacyTitle.Text" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Privacy Policy</value>
  </data>
  <data name="AboutPage_Privacy_Local.Text" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Local Processing: All photo processing is performed entirely on your device. No image data is uploaded to any server.</value>
  </data>
  <data name="AboutPage_Privacy_NoCollect.Text" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Location Lookup: For photos with GPS coordinates, only the latitude and longitude are sent to api.mirror-earth.com (an OpenStreetMap Nominatim mirror) to retrieve location names. This feature can be disabled in Settings at any time.</value>
  </data>
