  <data name="SplitTutorial_Step01_Content" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Prepare your Live Photo files and choose where the split results will be saved.

**📥 Input directory:** Pick a folder with Live Photos. The app will scan and identify split candidates automatically (this replaces the entire task queue). The input directory is not required — any content in the queue works.

**📤 Output directory:** Where the split images and videos will be saved.

**🔍 Scan button:** Scanning starts automatically once you set the input directory. You can also click "Scan" to refresh manually.

