  <data name="SplitTutorial_Step03_Title" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>🔗 Matching Method</value>
  </data>
  <data name="SplitTutorial_Step03_Content" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Filters which Live Photo protocols are detected when scanning.

**👍** The default "all single-file protocols" recognizes everything it finds.

**⚠️** Switch only when you have mixed protocols and want to process a specific one.</value>
  </data>
  <data name="SplitTutorial_Step04_Title" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>📱 Output Protocol</value>
  </data>
  <data name="SplitTutorial_Step04_Content" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Determines how the split images and videos are named.

**📋** Each option has a description in the dropdown list.

**🖥️** "None" keeps the original file naming. Apple and vivo use their respective device naming rules.</value>
  </data>
